	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Notes:\n- I would love PD but it doesn't seem to be worth it just for 12V - even the PPS mode tops out at 21V which is too little for the few 24V led strips.\n- If only two data channels are too little it should be easy to either change the current logic voltage converter to something else or to just add another one.\n\nTODO:\n- Analogue LEDs support"
